      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Up vote\n\nBeing australian leaves us in an awkward spot ping wise where JP servers and USW servers are practically the same being near ~200ms.\n\nWhen it comes to hosting events that utilise VRchat, small that the aussie community currently may be, super low latency would be a massive boon.\n\nFrom Creating content and having more responsive remote player IK and Voice sync to Hosting Events and VR-RL Portals to even just more playable latency for game worlds where response time is a more important for a enjoyable experience.",
